/// Law enforcement or government information/production requests. Captures
/// jurisdiction, request type, scope, deadlines (received/due),
/// confidentiality, subject account (if any), and fulfillment outcomes with
/// transparency and audit trail. Additional index optimizes SLA-driven
/// queues.
